      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>April 14, 2026</color>\n\"Dear Klee: Mommy knows that Big Brother Albedo's busy with research, Big Brother Mini Durin's busy studying, and Uncle Varka's being watched closely by Acting Grand Master Jean, so none of them can spend all day playing with you... But don't worry! There's a big sister named Prune who's heard some things Mommy said and is now heading to Mondstadt. She always says complicated stuff, sure. But she's just like you — at the perfect age to have carefree fun. Mommy just knows you two will become great friends!\"\n— Alice, in a letter to Klee\n<color=#ffacff>HoYoLAB:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/www.hoyolab.com/article/44646041</color>"
      }
